   "source": [
    "#### 使用案例：檢索增強生成 (RAG)\n",
    "\n",
    "對於RAG系統，請使用以下`prompt_name`值為您的查詢和文件建立專門的嵌入：\n",
    "* **對於查詢：** 使用 `prompt_name=\"Retrieval-query\"`.<br>\n",
    "    ```python\n",
    "    query_embedding = model.encode(\n",
    "        \"How do I use prompts with this model?\",\n",
    "        prompt_name=\"Retrieval-query\"\n",
    "    )\n",
    "    ```\n",
    "\n",
    "* **對於文件：** 使用`prompt_name=\"Retrieval-document\"`。為了進一步改進文件嵌入，您還可以直接使用 `prompt` 參數來包含標題：<br>\n",
    "  * **標題：**<br>\n",
    "    ```python\n",
    "    doc_embedding = model.encode(\n",
    "        \"The document text...\",\n",
    "        prompt=\"title: Using Prompts in RAG | text: \"\n",
    "    )\n",
    "    ```\n",
    "  * **沒有標題：**<br>\n",
    "    ```python\n",
    "    doc_embedding = model.encode(\n",
    "        \"The document text...\",\n",
    "        prompt=\"title: none | text: \"\n",
    "    )\n",
    "    ```\n",
    "\n",
    "#### 進一步閱讀\n",
    "\n",
    "* 有關所有可用嵌入Gemma prompt 的詳細信息，請參閱[型號卡](http://ai.google.dev/gemma/docs/embeddinggemma/model_card#prompt_instructions)。\n",
    "* 有關prompt 模板的一般信息，請參閱[句子轉換器文檔](https://sbert.net/examples/sentence_transformer/applications/computing-embeddings/README.html#prompt-templates)。\n",
    "* 有關RAG的演示，請參閱Gemma Cookbook中的[簡單RAG範例](https://github.com/google-gemini/gemma-cookbook/blob/main/Gemma/%5BGemma_3%5DRAG_with_EmbeddingGemma.ipynb)。\n"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "metadata": {
    "id": "aQh-QFAPsswb"
   },
   "source": [
    "## 分類\n",
    "\n",
    "分類是將一段文字指派給一個或多個預先定義類別或標籤的任務。這是自然語言處理 (NLP) 中最基本的任務之一。\n",
    "文字分類的一個實際應用是客戶支援票證路由。此流程會自動將客戶查詢引導至正確的部門，從而節省時間並減少手動工作。"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": null,
   "metadata": {
    "id": "C2Ufawl-tXvr"
   },
   "outputs": [
    {
     "name": "stdout",
     "output_type": "stream",
     "text": [
      "tensor([[0.4673, 0.5145, 0.3604],\n",
      "        [0.4191, 0.5010, 0.5966]])\n",
      "tensor([1, 2])\n",
      "🙋‍♂️ Excuse me, the app freezes on the login screen. It won't work even when I try to reset my password. -> 🤖 Technical Support\n",
      "🙋‍♂️ I would like to inquire about your enterprise plan pricing and features for a team of 50 people. -> 🤖 Sales Inquiry\n"
     ]
    }
   ],
   "source": [
    "labels = [\"Billing Issue\", \"Technical Support\", \"Sales Inquiry\"]\n",
    "\n",
    "sentence = [\n",
    "  \"Excuse me, the app freezes on the login screen. It won't work even when I try to reset my password.\",\n",
    "  \"I would like to inquire about your enterprise plan pricing and features for a team of 50 people.\",\n",
    "]\n",
    "\n",
    "# Calculate embeddings by calling model.encode()\n",
    "label_embeddings = model.encode(labels, prompt_name=\"Classification\")\n",
    "embeddings = model.encode(sentence, prompt_name=\"Classification\")\n",
    "\n",
    "# Calculate the embedding similarities\n",
    "similarities = model.similarity(embeddings, label_embeddings)\n",
    "print(similarities)\n",
    "\n",
    "idx = similarities.argmax(1)\n",
    "print(idx)\n",
    "\n",
    "for example in sentence:\n",
    "  print(\"🙋‍♂️\", example, \"-> 🤖\", labels[idx[sentence.index(example)]])"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "metadata": {
    "id": "IRUU2EIDPSmW"
   },
   "source": [
    "## 俄羅斯娃娃表徵學習 (MRL)\n",
    "\n",
    "EmbeddingGemma 利用 MRL 從一個模型提供多種嵌入尺寸。這是一種巧妙的訓練方法，可以創建單一的高品質嵌入，其中最重要的資訊集中在向量的開頭。\n",
    "這意味著您只需獲取完整嵌入的第一個 `N` 尺寸即可獲得更小但仍然非常有用的嵌入。使用較小的截斷嵌入可以顯著降低儲存成本並加快處理速度，但這種效率是以嵌入品質潛在較低為代價的。 MRL 可讓您根據應用的特定需求選擇速度和精度之間的最佳平衡。\n",
    "讓我們使用三個單字 `[\"apple\", \"banana\", \"car\"]` 並創建簡化的嵌入來了解 MRL 的工作原理。"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": null,
   "metadata": {
    "id": "B1q1F9I5PYSq"
   },
   "outputs": [
    {
     "name": "stdout",
     "output_type": "stream",
     "text": [
      "similarity function:  cosine\n",
      "tensor([[0.7510, 0.6685]])\n",
      "🙋‍♂️ apple vs. banana -> 🤖 score:  0.75102395\n",
      "🙋‍♂️ apple vs. car -> 🤖 score:  0.6684626\n"
     ]
    }
   ],
   "source": [
    "def check_word_similarities():\n",
    "  # Calculate the embedding similarities\n",
    "  print(\"similarity function: \", model.similarity_fn_name)\n",
    "  similarities = model.similarity(embeddings[0], embeddings[1:])\n",
    "  print(similarities)\n",
    "\n",
    "  for idx, word in enumerate(words[1:]):\n",
    "    print(\"🙋‍♂️ apple vs.\", word, \"-> 🤖 score: \", similarities.numpy()[0][idx])\n",
    "\n",
    "# Calculate embeddings by calling model.encode()\n",
    "embeddings = model.encode(words, prompt_name=\"STS\")\n",
    "\n",
    "check_word_similarities()"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "metadata": {
    "id": "_iv1xG0TPxkm"
   },
   "source": [
    "現在，為了獲得更快的應用程序，您不需要新模型。只需將完整嵌入**截斷**到第一個**512 維**即可。為了獲得最佳結果，也建議設定 `normalize_embeddings=True`，它將向量縮放到單位長度 1。"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": null,
   "metadata": {
    "id": "9Ue4aWh8PzdL"
   },
   "outputs": [
    {
     "name": "stdout",
     "output_type": "stream",
     "text": [
      "Embedding 1: (512,)\n",
      "Embedding 2: (512,)\n",
      "Embedding 3: (512,)\n",
      "--------------------------------------------------------------------------------\n",
      "similarity function:  cosine\n",
      "tensor([[0.7674, 0.7041]])\n",
      "🙋‍♂️ apple vs. banana -> 🤖 score:  0.767427\n",
      "🙋‍♂️ apple vs. car -> 🤖 score:  0.7040509\n"
     ]
    }
   ],
   "source": [
    "embeddings = model.encode(words, truncate_dim=512, normalize_embeddings=True)\n",
    "\n",
    "for idx, embedding in enumerate(embeddings):\n",
    "  print(f\"Embedding {idx+1}: {embedding.shape}\")\n",
    "\n",
    "print(\"-\"*80)\n",
    "check_word_similarities()"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "metadata": {
    "id": "lgkmgzfVP24M"
   },
   "source": [
    "在極度受限的環境中，您可以進一步將嵌入縮短至**256 維**。您也可以使用更有效率的**點積**來進行相似度計算，而不是標準的**餘弦**相似度。"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": null,
